    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Writable private PTEs are write-protected in both processes and page refcounts are bumped.",
      "narration": "For private writable mappings, both PTEs are made read-only and the page's reference and map counts go up. Cost scales with page tables, not data.",
