    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "Fork is cheap up front; the cost moves to later write faults.",
      "narration": "So fork is fast now and pays later. Redis snapshotting is the classic case: writes during BGSAVE copy pages and memory use grows.",
      "elements": [
